  tick and the effects' programs, from which SpeakJetMSA and SpeakJetSynth
  make every sound.  Generated from measurements of the chip; do not edit.

  One voicing period is a grain: three sines, phase reset at the trigger,
  under a fixed envelope, plus a pedestal, held at the chip's own rate and
  then through the output filter.
*/
